text = "• GOAL:
Navigate the 3D procedural maze and collect every gold coin to complete the run in record time.

• CONTROLS:
- Move: Drag the on-screen joystick on the bottom-left.
- Camera: Drag anywhere on the screen to rotate and tilt your camera angle.

• HAZARDS:
Avoid the red patrol spheres! They will chase you on sight. 
Touching an enemy immediately ends your run."
